  per-attachment resolve writing the 1-sample swapchain image. In
  this API the rendering's sample count is defined by the attached
  image views (VkRenderingInfo has no samples member); the depth
  attachment and the pipeline rasterizationSamples carry the same
  count. Layout transitions are manual, as dynamic rendering
  performs no implicit ones: UNDEFINED -> COLOR_ATTACHMENT_OPTIMAL
  before the pass for the MSAA color, the swapchain image and the
  depth image, and COLOR_ATTACHMENT_OPTIMAL -> PRESENT_SRC_KHR
  before present; the MSAA attachment is cleared and stored
  DONT_CARE, consumed only by the resolve, exactly like the
  CPU-driven render pass's transient. The quadrant wireframe cube,
  the compass wireframes and every GDD line now antialias like the
  CPU path.
